# Registry Persistence Mechanisms in Recycle Bin | T1547 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/registry/registry_event/registry_event_persistence_recycle_bin.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" (EventCode IN (12, 13, 14)) ((EventType="RenameKey" NewName="*\\CLSID\\{645FF040-5081-101B-9F08-00AA002F954E}\\shell\\open*") OR (EventType="SetValue" TargetObject="*\\CLSID\\{645FF040-5081-101B-9F08-00AA002F954E}\\shell\\open\\command\\(Default)*"))
